  "description": "The proposed application is for the renewal of the existing single glazed windows to the property. To the front elevation the glazing will be 20mm standard double glazing with matching timber frames (to match existing in appearance). To the rear elevation the glazing will be double glazed upvc. Where present all window operations and materials are to be retained and renewed in accordance with the appended section details to match existing. Rear windows will be of casement configuration.",
  "subdivision_of_building": null,
  "actual_completion_date": null,
  "lpa_app_no": "2024/2560",
  "decision": "Refused",
